NOTE ON DERIVATIVE COMPONENTS

The files `EthernetAppDemo/libraries/chip/enc28j60.c` and
`EthernetAppDemo/libraries/chip/enc28j60.h` are derived from the EtherCard
library (https://github.com/njh/EtherCard), originally authored by
Guido Socher and Jean-Claude Wippler, and are distributed under
GPL-2.0-or-later (SPDX: GPL-2.0-or-later). The full text of the GPLv2 license
applicable to those two files is provided in LICENSES/EtherCard.LICENSE.

The remainder of this repository, including all other source files in
`EthernetAppDemo/`, documentation, build scripts, and assets, is distributed
under the MIT license stated above.

Distribution of binaries that link the GPLv2 driver must comply with the
terms of GPL-2.0-or-later, which in practice means making the source code
of those two files available to recipients (already satisfied by the public
nature of this repository).
